# 🧱 Development & build tools
node_modules/
vendor/
Gemfile
Gemfile.lock
package.json
package-lock.json
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose-slim.yml
Dockerfile
README.md
INSTALL.md
CUSTOMIZE.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
FAQ.md

